#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: dfx-random-user-id.php
msgid "DFX Random User IDs"
msgstr "DFX IDs de usuario aleatorios"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: dfx-random-user-id.php
msgid "https://davefx.com/random-user-id"
msgstr "https://davefx.com/random-user-id"

#. Description of the plugin
#: dfx-random-user-id.php
msgid ""
"Sets random user IDs for created users. Randomizes the user ID for the "
"default user, if it exists."
msgstr ""
"Establece IDs de usuario aleatorios para los usuarios que se creen. "
"Aleatoriza el ID del usuario predeterminado, si existe."

#. Author of the plugin
#: dfx-random-user-id.php
msgid "David Marín Carreño (DaveFX)"
msgstr "David Marín Carreño (DaveFX)"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: dfx-random-user-id.php
msgid "https://davefx.com"
msgstr "https://davefx.com"

#: dfx-random-user-id.php:150
msgid "Random User IDs plugin has been successfully activated."
msgstr "El plugin «IDs de usuario aleatorios» ha sido activado con éxito."

#: dfx-random-user-id.php:153
msgid ""
"There was no user with ID=1 already, so no user ID has been randomized."
msgstr ""
"No existía ningún usuario con ID=1, por lo que no se ha aleatorizado ningún "
"ID de usuario."

#. translators: 1: the user's nickname, 2: the user's new ID.
#: dfx-random-user-id.php:156
#, php-format
msgid "The ID for user `%1$s` has been moved from 1 to %2$d."
msgstr "El ID del usuario `%1$s` se ha movido de 1 a %2$d."

#: dfx-random-user-id.php:157
msgid ""
"This plugin is designed to better being activated in first place, before any"
" other plugin or theme"
msgstr ""
"Este plugin está diseñado para ser activado en primer lugar, antes que "
"ningún otro plugin o tema."

#. translators: %d: the user's new ID.
#: dfx-random-user-id.php:159
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If there are any previously installed theme or plugin that added tables to "
"the database, you should check if any field in these tables includes "
"user_ids, and manually replace all the rows referencing user_id 1 with the "
"new user_id %d"
msgstr ""
"Si hay algún tema o plugin instalado que añada tablas a la base de datos, "
"deberías comprobar si algún campo de esas tablas incluye identificadores de "
"usuario, y reemplazar manualmente todas las filas que hagan referencia al "
"usuario con ID 1 con el nuevo ID de usuario %d"

#: dfx-random-user-id.php:170
msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "Descartar"

#: includes/settings.php:83 includes/settings.php:275
msgid "Both limits must be whole numbers."
msgstr "Los dos límites deben ser números enteros."

#. translators: %s: largest allowed ID.
#: includes/settings.php:96 includes/settings.php:277
#, php-format
msgid "The limits must be between 1 and %s."
msgstr "Los límites deben estar entre 1 y %s."

#: includes/settings.php:100 includes/settings.php:278
msgid "The minimum must be lower than the maximum."
msgstr "El mínimo debe ser menor que el máximo."

#. translators: %s: smallest number of IDs the range must hold.
#: includes/settings.php:107
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The range is too narrow for this site: it must hold at least %s IDs, ten for"
" every user."
msgstr ""
"El rango es demasiado estrecho para este sitio: debe abarcar al menos %s "
"IDs, diez por cada usuario."

#: includes/settings.php:164 includes/settings.php:165
#: includes/settings.php:245
msgid "Random User IDs"
msgstr "IDs de usuario aleatorios"

#: includes/settings.php:185 includes/settings.php:247
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Ajustes"

#: includes/settings.php:202
msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to change these settings."
msgstr "Lo sentimos, no tiene permiso para cambiar estos ajustes."

#: includes/settings.php:279
msgid ""
"The range is too narrow for this site: it must hold at least ten IDs for "
"every user, and never fewer than 1,000."
msgstr ""
"El rango es demasiado estrecho para este sitio: debe abarcar al menos diez "
"IDs por cada usuario, y nunca menos de 1.000."

#: includes/settings.php:283
msgid "The range was not changed."
msgstr "El rango no se ha modificado."

#: includes/settings.php:285
msgid ""
"Range saved. It applies to the users created from now on; existing IDs do "
"not change."
msgstr ""
"Rango guardado. Se aplica a los usuarios que se creen a partir de ahora; los"
" IDs existentes no cambian."

#: includes/settings.php:287
msgid "The default range has been restored."
msgstr "Se ha restablecido el rango predeterminado."

#: includes/settings.php:300
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Estado"

#: includes/settings.php:303
msgid "Users"
msgstr "Usuarios"

#: includes/settings.php:306
msgid "User with ID 1"
msgstr "Usuario con ID 1"

#: includes/settings.php:307
msgid "Exists"
msgstr "Existe"

#: includes/settings.php:307
msgid "None"
msgstr "No hay"

#: includes/settings.php:308
msgid ""
"ID 1 is the first one an attacker tries. The plugin moves it when it is "
"activated; it exists again only if it was created later or the move failed."
msgstr ""
"El ID 1 es el primero que prueba un atacante. El plugin lo cambia al "
"activarse; solo vuelve a existir si se creó después o si el cambio falló."

#: includes/settings.php:312
msgid "Users with IDs below 1,000"
msgstr "Usuarios con ID inferior a 1.000"

#: includes/settings.php:314
msgid ""
"Low IDs are easy to guess. They usually belong to users created before the "
"plugin was activated, and the plugin does not change them."
msgstr ""
"Los IDs bajos son fáciles de adivinar. Suelen ser de usuarios creados antes "
"de activar el plugin, y el plugin no los cambia."

#: includes/settings.php:318
msgid "Users whose ID follows another user's"
msgstr "Usuarios cuyo ID es el siguiente al de otro usuario"

#: includes/settings.php:320
msgid ""
"Knowing one of these IDs gives away the next one. They usually come from "
"before the plugin was activated, or from a very narrow range."
msgstr ""
"Conocer uno de estos IDs delata el siguiente. Suelen venir de antes de "
"activar el plugin o de un rango muy estrecho."

#: includes/settings.php:325
msgid "First user"
msgstr "Primer usuario"

#. translators: %s: the new user ID.
#: includes/settings.php:327
#, php-format
msgid "Moved from ID 1 to %s on activation"
msgstr "Movido del ID 1 al %s al activar el plugin"

#: includes/settings.php:367
msgid "Range for new user IDs"
msgstr "Rango de los IDs de los usuarios nuevos"

#: includes/settings.php:368
msgid ""
"Every new user gets a random ID between these two numbers. Existing users "
"keep their IDs. The wider the range, the harder the IDs are to guess."
msgstr ""
"Cada usuario nuevo recibe un ID aleatorio entre estos dos números. Los "
"usuarios existentes conservan sus IDs. Cuanto más amplio sea el rango, más "
"difícil será adivinarlos."

#. translators: 1: minimum ID, 2: maximum ID.
#: includes/settings.php:372
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Code on this site changes the range with the dfx_random_user_id_min_id or "
"dfx_random_user_id_max_id filters, so the range in use is %1$s to %2$s, "
"whatever is saved here."
msgstr ""
"Hay código en este sitio que cambia el rango con los filtros "
"dfx_random_user_id_min_id o dfx_random_user_id_max_id, así que el rango en "
"uso es de %1$s a %2$s, se guarde aquí lo que se guarde."

#: includes/settings.php:379
msgid "Minimum ID"
msgstr "ID mínimo"

#: includes/settings.php:381
msgid "Maximum ID"
msgstr "ID máximo"

#. translators: %s: largest allowed ID.
#: includes/settings.php:384
#, php-format
msgid "At most %s, so that the IDs stay exact in JavaScript."
msgstr "Como máximo %s, para que los IDs se mantengan exactos en JavaScript."

#: includes/settings.php:387
msgid "Save range"
msgstr "Guardar rango"

#: includes/settings.php:391
msgid "Restore the default range"
msgstr "Restablecer el rango predeterminado"
